# jellyfin-mcp — Cursor rules
Use portmanteau tools: jellyfin_library, jellyfin_media, jellyfin_search, jellyfin_playback, jellyfin_server.
Responses are dicts with success/message. WebSocket events via jellyfin service. RAG: sync then search.

## Session Context (jellyfin-mcp)
Before starting work: call jellyfin_help(operation="discover"), check backend :10934/health.
At end of work: run ruff check src/, pytest tests/unit -q, update docs/TOOLS.md if tools changed.
